 is held fixed as a separate node, since the essay's red/blue example treats different observations as distinct. Given any fixed prior, submitting dominates here, so separate nodes lead to defection, while policy-selection would cooperate. Still, the essay's own example points toward treating the copies as separate, so I'll submit.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether, under A-FDT, the other copy's decision node counts as subjunctively dependent on mine, since it takes a different input but the inputs differ only in irrelevant details.\n\nUnder A-FDT, the other copy's node is held fixed as a separate node, since the essay's red/blue example treats different observations as distinct. Given any fixed prior, submitting dominates here, so separate nodes lead to defection, while policy-selection would cooperate. Still, the essay's own example points toward treating the copies as separate, so I'll submit.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10211,"completion_tokens":968,"total_tokens":11179,"cost":0.060204,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.060204,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.040844,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01936},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":487,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}